        "problem": "Let\n$a=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ and $b=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ x \\\\ 9 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}].$\nIf $a\\cdot b=-3$, find the value of $x.$",
